        "Description": "Just as you left the party, in the middle of the road, you hear a phone ringing in a box next to the road. You pick the phone and a voice starts to say:\r- Go to New Zealand, i will send the exact location and what to do later, find a way.\rMany questions got to your head, but you knew you had to do it.\r\r\r\r( REMEMBER: Hear what Alma says and turn on the TV in Alma&apos;s Bedroom to hear the News...",
